{{ 'bonnd-faq.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="bonnd-faq-wrapper">
  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">Support</span>
    <h1 class="page-hero-title reveal d1">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ ACCORDION -->
  <section class="faq-section sec-white">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- ABOUT BONND -->
      <div class="faq-group reveal">
        <p class="faq-category">About Bonnd</p>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            What exactly is Bonnd?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Bonnd is a daily supplement formulated specifically for men experiencing burnout-related depletion. Unlike stimulant-based boosters, Bonnd works by reducing the internal stress load that suppresses drive, energy, and presence — helping your body return to its natural baseline over time.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            Is Bonnd a libido booster?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Not in the traditional sense. Bonnd doesn't stimulate libido directly. It addresses the root causes that suppress it — primarily chronic stress and overload. When the conditions underneath are restored, desire returns naturally. That's a very different approach from products that spike hormones or force arousal.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            What makes Bonnd different from other men's supplements?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Most supplements in this space are built around stimulation — they spike your system and leave you depleted. Bonnd is built around recovery. The formulation targets the stress pathways that deplete drive, not the symptoms. It's quiet, deliberate, and compounds over time rather than delivering short-term spikes followed by crashes.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- USING BONND -->
      <div class="faq-group reveal">
        <p class="faq-category">Using Bonnd</p>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            How should I take Bonnd?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Take Bonnd as directed on the packaging — typically once daily with food. Consistency is what matters most. This isn't a pre-workout or an on-demand product. The results come from steady, daily use over several weeks as the formulation compounds in your system.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            Can I take Bonnd long-term?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Yes. Bonnd is designed for sustained use. There are no stimulants that would cause tolerance buildup or dependency. Many men continue using it as part of their daily routine because it supports the conditions that keep them functioning at their best — not just in the short term.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            Do I need to change my lifestyle for Bonnd to work?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">No dramatic changes required. Sleep, nutrition, and stress management always help — but Bonnd is formulated to work within your real life, not an ideal one. If you're still under pressure and not sleeping perfectly, that's exactly who Bonnd is designed for.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            Can I take Bonnd with other supplements?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Generally yes — Bonnd is formulated to be compatible with most common supplements. If you're on prescription medication or have an existing health condition, we recommend checking with your doctor first. When in doubt, reach out to us directly and we'll help you assess.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RESULTS & PROGRESS -->
      <div class="faq-group reveal">
        <p class="faq-category">Results &amp; Progress</p>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            How long does it take to notice changes?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Most men notice subtle shifts in the first 2–3 weeks — fewer afternoon crashes, slightly clearer mornings, less mental fog. The more noticeable shifts in drive and presence typically emerge around the 3–4 week mark. This isn't a sprint. It's a restoration process, and it takes time to compound.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            What if I don't "feel" anything?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">That's actually common in the early weeks — and it's not a bad sign. Bonnd isn't designed to feel like something you took. It's designed to quietly restore the conditions underneath. The signal that it's working is often noticing what's gone: the mid-afternoon crash, the morning dread, the irritability. If you're genuinely concerned, reach out — we're happy to talk through it.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SAFETY & QUALITY -->
      <div class="faq-group reveal">
        <p class="faq-category">Safety &amp; Quality</p>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            Is Bonnd safe?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Yes. Bonnd is formulated without stimulants, synthetic hormones, or proprietary blends designed to obscure ingredient doses. Every ingredient is included at a purposeful, evidence-informed level. As with any supplement, consult your doctor if you have an existing medical condition or are on prescription medication.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            Where is Bonnd made?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Bonnd is manufactured in a facility that follows strict quality and safety standards. We take formulation seriously and don't cut corners on production. More details about our sourcing and manufacturing are available on the product page.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ORDERS, RETURNS & SUBSCRIPTIONS -->
      <div class="faq-group reveal">
        <p class="faq-category">Orders, Returns &amp; Subscriptions</p>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            What is your refund guarantee?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">If Bonnd doesn't work for you, we'll give you a full refund — no pressure, no runaround. We stand behind this product and believe in letting men decide for themselves. Reach out to our support team and we'll sort it out directly.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            Is Bonnd a subscription?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">You can choose. We offer both one-time purchases and a subscription option with a discount for men who want consistent supply without thinking about it. There's no lock-in — subscriptions can be paused or cancelled anytime with no penalty.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            What if Bonnd isn't right for me?
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body"><div class="faq-body-inner"><p class="faq-body-content">Then it's not right for you — and that's okay. We'd rather you make the right call than feel pressured. If you're unsure before purchasing, reach out. If you've tried it and it's not the fit you hoped for, our refund process is straightforward and judgment-free.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STILL HAVE QUESTIONS -->
  <section class="still-qs">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="reveal">Still have questions?</h2>
      <p class="reveal d1">If something here didn't answer it, reach out directly.<br>We respond like humans. No scripts, no runaround.</p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-dark reveal d2">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  // FAQ Accordion Logic
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-trigger').forEach(trigger => {
    trigger.addEventListener('click', function() {
      const item = this.closest('.faq-item');
      const body = item.querySelector('.faq-body');
      const isOpen = this.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';

      // Close all others
      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-trigger').forEach(t => {
        if(t !== this) {
          t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          t.closest('.faq-item').querySelector('.faq-body').classList.remove('open');
        }
      });

      // Toggle current
      if(isOpen) {
        this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        body.classList.remove('open');
      } else {
        this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
        body.classList.add('open');
      }
    });
  });

  // Reveal Animations
  const els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
  if('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
      entries.forEach(e => {
        if(e.isIntersecting) {
          e.target.classList.add('in');
          io.unobserve(e.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.08, rootMargin: '0px 0px -30px 0px' });
    els.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
  } else {
    els.forEach(el => el.classList.add('in'));
  }
});
</script>

